        educational_objective: `Distinguish myasthenia gravis (postsynaptic AChR antibodies, decremental repetitive stimulation response, thymoma association, worsens with activity) from Lambert-Eaton myasthenic syndrome (presynaptic voltage-gated calcium channel antibodies, incremental response, small cell lung cancer association, improves with activity).`,
